{"data":{"body":"[P2] Remove the remaining cross-clock containment check. This parent expectation still compares the callback's service timestamps with the SDK Workflow interval. A completion timestamp beyond `Workflow.end_time` therefore rejects correct history and Invocation-2 linkage. The new skew test keeps the callback inside the Workflow and misses this boundary. Add `$allow_outside: true`, retaining parent identity and links, and add a regression with the service completion timestamp beyond the Workflow end.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABBC_1jA","finding_digest":"8a859bc0b26b519444e7744bbabf44f3fd7e08dc6aeed63eba043ff4c71ba495","finding_id":"arf_v1_rkczxqfsnnizirhhorf3vp2e6p","finding_key":"otel-execution-26::target-callback-before-observation::cross-clock-ordering","identity_key":"otel-execution-26::target-callback-before-observation::cross-clock-ordering","line":216,"observation_digest":"77db0b14be20382d59e729109e42f85773be7032aef3a9bfd14ae5c471c102f7","observation_id":"aro_v1_o7nqwff6ea4c2wphfeij4qxyk5","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-otel/test-requirements/otel-execution/otel-execution-26.yaml","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rkczxqfsnnizirhhorf3vp2e6p","published_at":"2026-10-24T00:05:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ckklp5lnfidynmv4rqdgw2ondb","reviewed_base_sha":"fac2fef2ba9456e6000d57556c8a22266d191c47","reviewed_head_sha":"298dd6e585f3b3ad0bb2c1a54249727a2ad3d261","reviewer":"codex","start_line":212,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_y5snkkimiiboo4tiplv2w5ofui"},"pull_request":{"number":131},"record_id":"art_v1_omyugweg2bmvd3h6gxpfw5itpb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-24T00:05:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
